            <details class="wapp__guide">
              <summary><h2 class="wapp__h2">Before you swap</h2><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" /></svg></summary>
              <div class="wapp__guide-grid">
                <article class="wapp__tile"><span class="wapp__tile-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8" /><path d="M12 8v4l2.5 2" /></svg></span><h3>Keep some for fees</h3><p>Every swap pays a network fee in that network's own coin (SOL, ETH, BNB and so on). Keep a little in the same wallet, or the swap will fail.</p></article>
                <article class="wapp__tile"><span class="wapp__tile-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18"><path d="M19 5L5 19M7.5 8a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0-3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0 3zM16.5 19a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0-3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0 3z" /></svg></span><h3>Slippage and the minimum</h3><p>The minimum you will receive is shown before you sign. If the price moves further than your slippage allows, the swap is rejected and nothing is exchanged.</p></article>
                <article class="wapp__tile"><span class="wapp__tile-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18"><path d="M12 3l9 5-9 5-9-5 9-5zM3 13l9 5 9-5" /></svg></span><h3>Quotes expire</h3><p>A quote is only good for a short time and the screen counts it down. If it runs out, get a new one rather than signing an old price.</p></article>
                <article class="wapp__tile"><span class="wapp__tile-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18"><path d="M12 3l8 3v6c0 4.5-3.2 7.8-8 9-4.8-1.2-8-4.5-8-9V6z" /></svg></span><h3>Check the token</h3><p>Names and symbols are not unique, so look at the address under each box. Read the safety notes before you buy a token you do not know.</p></article>
              </div>
            </details>
          </template>
          <div data-sw-panel="new" class="wapp__stack" hidden></div>
          <div data-sw-panel="markets" class="wapp__stack" hidden></div>
          <div data-sw-panel="activity" class="wapp__stack" hidden></div>
          <p class="wapp__fine">
            Aretia Swings finds routes through outside liquidity providers and shows you the quote, the minimum you will receive and every fee before anything is signed. Your wallet signs; Aretia never holds your keys. The Swap tab shows which networks are enabled; the rest are marked not enabled yet. Swaps are not sent through a protected route, so large trades in thin pools can be sandwiched. Quotes are not guarantees, and a token being listed here is never an endorsement.
          </p>
